WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.316
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:10.317 --> 00:00:14.220
I'm a Siberian tiger.

3
00:00:14.221 --> 00:00:18.245
Tigers are the largest cats on earth.

4
00:00:18.246 --> 00:00:20.999
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.572
Siberian tigers live in Asia.

6
00:00:25.573 --> 00:00:29.697
We make our homes in forests.

7
00:00:29.698 --> 00:00:32.619
Can you swim?

8
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:36.763
All tigers are great swimmers!

9
00:00:36.764 --> 00:00:41.226
We're the only big cats that like water.

10
00:00:41.227 --> 00:00:44.542
I like your stripes.

11
00:00:44.543 --> 00:00:49.124
Each tiger's stripes are different.

12
00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:53.802
Our stripes help us hide in the forest.

13
00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:58.011
Then our prey can't see us!

14
00:00:58.012 --> 00:01:00.717
What do you eat?

15
00:01:00.718 --> 00:01:05.792
We hunt big animals like elk and bears.

16
00:01:05.793 --> 00:01:09.539
We usually hunt at night.

17
00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:14.681
We can see very well in the dark.

18
00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:18.046
Are you dangerous?

19
00:01:18.047 --> 00:01:22.435
We have sharp teeth and claws.

20
00:01:22.436 --> 00:01:28.226
Our roars are very loud.

21
00:01:28.227 --> 00:01:33.127
But we usually stay away from people.

22
00:01:33.128 --> 00:01:37.270
Do you live with other tigers?

23
00:01:37.271 --> 00:01:43.377
Nope! We stay away from each other.

24
00:01:43.378 --> 00:01:47.901
We like to be alone.

25
00:01:47.902 --> 00:01:51.821
It's getting dark—time to eat.

26
00:01:51.822 --> 00:01:54.149
Good-bye!

27
00:01:54.150 --> 00:02:02.740
Good-bye, Siberian Tiger!

